    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "```python\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"labels_final.csv\")\nout = (df[~df.possibly_incomplete]\n       .groupby(\"section\").label.value_counts(normalize=True)\n       .mul(100).round(1).unstack(fill_value=0))\nprint(out)\n```\n\nAnd raw counts including everything:\n\n```python\npd.crosstab(df.section, df.label, margins=True)\n```\n\nIf `possibly_incomplete` came in as strings (\"True\"/\"False\"), convert first: `df.possibly_incomplete = df.possibly_incomplete.astype(str).str.lower().eq(\"true\")`."
     ]
